      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P014 explicitly prescribes retaining alternatives under all three identified conditions."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "signal_basis",
    "value": "Candidate alignments are checked against independently supported dates and additional histories. Multiple fitting alignments, conflicting references or insufficient overlap leave placement unresolved; equally plausible shifts are explicitly identified as a signal of unresolved chronology.",
    "scope": "Prospective assessment of chronological ambiguity during alignment checks, without asserting that ambiguity has already occurred in this project.",
